  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%'><b><span style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\n  line-height:115%'>Observed Value<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=284 valign=top style='width:212.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%'><b><span style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Biological\r\n  Reference Interval<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <td width=236 valign=top style='width:177.2pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=142 valign=top style='width:106.3pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center;line-height:115%'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=284 valign=top style='width:212.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center;line-height:115%'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <td width=236 valign=top style='width:177.2pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><b><span\r\n  style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>HLA B27 Detection<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=142 valign=top style='width:106.3pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Positive<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=284 valign=top style='width:212.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%'><span style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Negative<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <td width=236 valign=top style='width:177.2pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><b><span\r\n  style='font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Method:\r\n  <\/span><\/b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Flow\r\n  Cytometry<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=142 valign=top style='width:106.3pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><span\r\n  style='font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=284 valign=top style='width:212.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%'><span style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Clinical Background:<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Human leukocyte antigen B27 (HLA-B27) is a\r\nmajor histocompatibility complex class 1 molecule that is strongly associated\r\nwith the disease ankylosing spondylitis. Testing for HLA-B27 is of diagnostic\r\nvalue because more than 90% of patients with ankylosing spondylitis possess B27\r\nallele, but only 1% of people with HLA-B27 develop the disease.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>HLA B27 is also known for its associations with\r\nother diseases (like Reiter\u2019s disease, Acute anterior uveitis, Psoriatic\r\narthritis, Juvenile idiopathic arthritis).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Limitations:<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022\r\n<\/span><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>HLA B7 can\r\ncross react with anti-HLA B27 antibody giving false positive test result. This\r\ncan be confirmed by alternate<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 method discriminating B7 &amp; B27 or by\r\nancillary molecular techniques.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022\r\n<\/span><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Since the\r\nassay is cut-off based analysis by Flow cytometric expression of HLA B27 antigen,\r\nany result +\/- 10% of cut-\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 off is<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 considered as Borderline, which can be\r\nconfirmed by Molecular assays like Microarray.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022 <\/span><span\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>HLA B27 should only be\r\nused as an adjunct to clinical diagnosis since it only gives predisposition for\r\nthe development\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nofdisease.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbs