lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Unit<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=248 valign=top style='width:186.3pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%'><b><u><span style='font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Biological Reference Interval<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <td width=267 valign=top style='width:199.9pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=84 valign=top style='width:63.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center;line-height:115%'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=84 valign=top style='width:63.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center;line-height:115%'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=248 valign=top style='width:186.3pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center;line-height:115%'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <td width=267 valign=top style='width:199.9pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><b><span\r\n  style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>HLA B27, <\/span><\/b><b><span\r\n  style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>EDTA Blood<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=84 valign=top style='width:63.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>NEGATIVE<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=84 valign=top style='width:63.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=248 valign=top style='width:186.3pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'><\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <td width=267 valign=top style='width:199.9pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><b><span\r\n  style='font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Method:\r\n  <\/span><\/b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Flow\r\n  Cytometry<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=84 valign=top style='width:63.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><span\r\n  style='font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=84 valign=top style='width:63.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%;text-autospace:none'><span\r\n  style='font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=248 valign=top style='width:186.3pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:115%'><span style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Note :<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.5pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>1. Tests\r\nconducted on EDTA\/Heparin\/ACD whole blood.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.5pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>2. Anti HLA-B27\r\nantibody cross reacts with several other antigens of HLA-B group specially\r\nHLA-B27\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.5pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 leading to\r\nfalse positive results.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.5pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>3. In case of\r\nHLA-B27 negative Spondyloarthropathy, further testing recommended is HLA-C*06\r\nPositive <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.5pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 in Psoriatic\r\narthritis) and HLA-B*07 (positive in Juvenile and Undifferentiated\r\nSpondyloarthropathy).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span style='font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Comments<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.5pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>HLA-B27 is a\r\nmajor histocompatibility complex (MHC) class 1 molecule which is considered to\r\nbe an important criteria for classification of Axial spondyloarthropathies and\r\nhelps in establishing an early diagnosis of Ankylosing spondyloarthropathies\r\nbefore the development of irreversible deformity. In 2009, the Assessment of\r\nSpondyoarthritis International Society (ASAS) proposed new criteria for\r\nclassification of Axial spondyloarthritis which are applicable to individuals\r\nwith back pain = 3 months and age of onset &lt;45 years. One important criteria\r\nis the presence of HLA-B27.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=MsoNormalTable border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0\r\n style='margin-left:19.65pt;border-collapse:collapse'>\r\n <tr style='height:18.0pt'>\r\n  <td width=245 valign=top style='width:183.75pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:18.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:9.5pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DISEASE<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=96 valign=top style='width:72.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:18.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:9.5pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>RISK IN %<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:18.0pt'>\r\n  <td width=245 valign=top style='width:183.75pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:18.0pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=96 valign=top style='width:72.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\